---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<!-- workshop-v2 -->
<BaseLayout
  title="Nolan's Workshop"
  description="Nolan's Workshop: woodworking projects, shop systems, jigs, work surfaces, finishing, tools, and build lessons."
>
  <header class="subhero subhero--workshop">
    <div class="shell subhero-grid">
      <div class="subhero-copy">
        <div class="subhero-badges">
          <span>WOOD</span>
          <span>TOOLS</span>
          <span>JIGS</span>
          <span>BUILD LOG</span>
        </div>
        <p class="subhero-kicker">NOLAN'S WORKSHOP // BUILT TO BE USED</p>
        <h1>Sawdust is just another kind of debugging.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Shop systems, jigs, work surfaces, furniture, finishing, and practical builds where the useful part is often the decision that changed halfway through.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button workshop-button" href="#workshop-zones">Enter the shop ↓</a>
          <a class="button secondary workshop-secondary" href="/about/">Meet the builder</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="workshop-bench" data-workshop-plaque aria-label="Workshop build philosophy">
        <span class="plaque-dust" data-plaque-dust aria-hidden="true"><svg class="plaque-vac" viewBox="0 0 220 120" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="vac-tank" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="0"><stop stop-color="#687078"/><stop offset=".25" stop-color="#a5adb0"/><stop offset=".67" stop-color="#757e84"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#414b52"/></linearGradient>
            <linearGradient id="vac-top" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#555a5b"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#202729"/></linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <path d="M44 84 C54 80 59 64 69 59 C83 51 93 59 102 61 C111 63 117 55 120 49" fill="none" stroke="#111b20" stroke-width="15" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <path d="M44 84 C54 80 59 64 69 59 C83 51 93 59 102 61 C111 63 117 55 120 49" fill="none" stroke="#667076" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="2 4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <path d="M6 85 Q22 80 45 79 L51 87 Q26 90 5 91Z" fill="#353d3e" stroke="#151a1b" stroke-width="2"/>
          <path d="M7 85 L42 83" stroke="#7e8580" stroke-width="1.2" opacity=".7"/>
          <path d="M119 44 L191 44 L187 91 Q185 103 173 104 L137 104 Q124 102 123 91Z" fill="url(#vac-tank)" stroke="#313b3f" stroke-width="2.5"/>
          <path d="M126 55 L184 55 M130 93 Q151 99 177 93" fill="none" stroke="#d3d5cd" stroke-width="1.5" opacity=".45"/>
          <path d="M119 43 Q121 34 130 32 L182 32 Q190 34 192 43 L190 50 L120 50Z" fill="url(#vac-top)" stroke="#1f272b" stroke-width="2"/>
          <path d="M130 32 L134 22 Q140 18 148 19 L171 19 Q178 19 181 24 L184 32" fill="none" stroke="#282d2d" stroke-width="6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <path d="M137 39 L176 39 M139 43 L174 43" stroke="#8e989a" stroke-width="1.5" opacity=".65"/>
          <rect x="135" y="58" width="45" height="10" rx="2" fill="#ae7142" stroke="#734a2d" stroke-width="1"/>
          <path d="M140 63 H174" stroke="#efd0a7" stroke-width="1" opacity=".8"/>
          <path d="M117 53 Q108 56 109 62 L118 68" fill="none" stroke="#303a3c" stroke-width="6"/>
          <path d="M128 101 L184 101" stroke="#2b3031" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <g class="plaque-vac__wheel"><circle cx="136" cy="106" r="9" fill="#202526" stroke="#657072" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M136 99v14 M129 106h14" stroke="#767d7d" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="136" cy="106" r="2" fill="#a8aaa4"/></g>
          <g class="plaque-vac__wheel"><circle cx="177" cy="106" r="9" fill="#202526" stroke="#657072" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M177 99v14 M170 106h14" stroke="#767d7d" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="177" cy="106" r="2" fill="#a8aaa4"/></g>
        </svg></span>
        <div class="bench-rule bench-rule--top"></div>
        <div class="bench-stamp egg-mark egg-mark--workshop" data-egg="NO FANTASY SHOP REQUIRED" tabindex="0" role="note" aria-label="Hidden note: No fantasy shop required.">NOLAN'S<br/>WORKSHOP</div>
        <button class="trail-marker trail-marker--workshop" type="button" data-trail-marker="workshop-trail" aria-label="Hidden trail marker: Sawdust Trail">◇</button>
        <div class="bench-note">
          <span>01</span>
          <strong>Fit the workflow</strong>
          <small>Not the fantasy shop.</small>
        </div>
        <div class="bench-note">
          <span>02</span>
          <strong>Use what I own</strong>
          <small>Buy only when the gap is real.</small>
        </div>
        <div class="bench-note">
          <span>03</span>
          <strong>Prototype, test, revise</strong>
          <small>The first cut is not sacred.</small>
        </div>
        <div class="bench-rule bench-rule--bottom"></div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section section--warm workshop-zones" id="workshop-zones">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading section-heading--punch">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">What lives here</p>
          <h2>Systems for the shop. Projects for the fun of it.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-intro">
          Nolan's Workshop is the physical-build side of the same builder brain: solve the actual problem, respect the constraints, and don't turn the tool into a bigger project than the work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="workshop-grid workshop-grid--wow">
        <article class="workshop-card workshop-card--jigs">
          <span class="workshop-card__number">01</span>
          <h3>Shop systems & jigs</h3>
          <p>Purpose-built sleds, stands, storage, workholding, and fixtures that make repeated work faster, safer, or more accurate.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="workshop-card workshop-card--furniture">
          <span class="workshop-card__number">02</span>
          <h3>Work surfaces & furniture</h3>
          <p>Benches, tables, tops, and utility builds where structure, mobility, finish, and real use beat showroom perfection.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="workshop-card workshop-card--experiments">
          <span class="workshop-card__number">03</span>
          <h3>Small builds & experiments</h3>
          <p>Routing, joinery, finishing, material choices, mistakes, revisions, and the occasional “that should probably work” prototype.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section workshop-playground">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading section-heading--punch">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Shop rules are more like guidelines</p>
          <h2>Please keep hands clear of the imaginary blade.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-intro">
          Some pages have hover effects. The Workshop has power tools. Move around. You'll figure it out.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="sr-only" data-shop-live role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
      <div class="workshop-play-grid">
        <div class="saw-cut-stage" data-saw-cut>
          <div class="saw-cut-reveal">
            <span>OFFCUT REMOVED</span>
            <strong>Measure twice. Cut once.</strong>
            <small>Stare at it for 20 minutes anyway.</small>
          </div>

          <div class="saw-cut-slab saw-cut-slab--top" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="saw-cut-grain"></div>
            <span>NOLAN'S WORKSHOP</span>
          </div>
          <div class="saw-cut-slab saw-cut-slab--bottom" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="saw-cut-grain"></div>
            <small>BUILT TO BE USED</small>
          </div>

          <div class="saw-cut-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="circular-saw circular-saw--svg" data-circular-saw aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 420 260" role="presentation" focusable="false">
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="bodyBlue" x1="0.05" y1="0.05" x2="0.9" y2="1">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#426f92"/>
                  <stop offset="18%" stop-color="#24587e"/>
                  <stop offset="48%" stop-color="#123f64"/>
                  <stop offset="78%" stop-color="#0b2d49"/>
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#071b2c"/>
                </linearGradient>
                <linearGradient id="bodyBlueSide" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0.9">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#163f5f"/>
                  <stop offset="52%" stop-color="#0b2b46"/>
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#061622"/>
                </linearGradient>
                <linearGradient id="rubber" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0.8" y2="1">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#40484c"/>
                  <stop offset="34%" stop-color="#242a2d"/>
                  <stop offset="72%" stop-color="#111517"/>
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#07090a"/>
                </linearGradient>
                <linearGradient id="castAluminum" x1="0.08" y1="0.05" x2="0.92" y2="1">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#f1f3f3"/>
                  <stop offset="16%" stop-color="#d4d8d9"/>
                  <stop offset="37%" stop-color="#9ba3a6"/>
                  <stop offset="57%" stop-color="#6e777b"/>
                  <stop offset="76%" stop-color="#c4c9cb"/>
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#555e62"/>
                </linearGradient>
                <linearGradient id="shoeMetal" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#aeb5b8"/>
                  <stop offset="28%" stop-color="#858e92"/>
                  <stop offset="68%" stop-color="#5a6367"/>
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#343b3e"/>
                </linearGradient>
                <radialGradient id="bladeDisc" cx="35%" cy="28%" r="78%">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#f7f8f8"/>
                  <stop offset="28%" stop-color="#d8dcde"/>
                  <stop offset="58%" stop-color="#a0a7aa"/>
                  <stop offset="83%" stop-color="#70797d"/>
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#485055"/>
                </radialGradient>
                <radialGradient id="motorCap" cx="34%" cy="30%" r="72%">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#646e73"/>
                  <stop offset="36%" stop-color="#333b3f"/>
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#101416"/>
                </radialGradient>
                <filter id="toolShadow" x="-35%" y="-40%" width="185%" height="210%">
                  <feDropShadow dx="0" dy="13" stdDeviation="9" flood-color="#000" flood-opacity=".34"/>
                  <feDropShadow dx="0" dy="2" stdDeviation="1.2" flood-color="#000" flood-opacity=".28"/>
                </filter>
                <filter id="bodyTexture" x="-15%" y="-15%" width="130%" height="130%">
                  <feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency=".72" numOctaves="2" seed="12" result="grain"/>
                  <feColorMatrix in="grain" type="matrix"
                    values="0 0 0 0 0.25
                            0 0 0 0 0.25
                            0 0 0 0 0.25
                            0 0 0 .055 0" result="faint"/>
                  <feBlend in="SourceGraphic" in2="faint" mode="multiply"/>
                </filter>
                <filter id="bladeBlur" x="-10%" y="-10%" width="120%" height="120%">
                  <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=".35"/>
                </filter>
              </defs>

              <g class="saw-svg__machine" filter="url(#toolShadow)">
                <!-- stamped steel shoe: a thin perspective plate, not a cartoon rectangle -->
                <path class="saw-svg__shoe"
                  d="M28 203 L356 203 L397 213 L382 224 L39 224 L14 215 Z"
                  fill="url(#shoeMetal)" stroke="#252c2f" stroke-width="2"/>
                <path d="M34 206 L354 206 L385 213"
                  fill="none" stroke="#eef1f1" stroke-opacity=".28" stroke-width="1.6"/>
                <path d="M42 220 L375 220"
                  fill="none" stroke="#14191b" stroke-opacity=".46" stroke-width="1.7"/>

                <!-- blade, mostly hidden by the upper guard like a real sidewinder -->
                <g class="saw-svg__blade-group" filter="url(#bladeBlur)">
                  <circle cx="128" cy="174" r="73" fill="url(#bladeDisc)" stroke="#555e62" stroke-width="2.5"/>
                  <circle cx="128" cy="174" r="68" fill="none" stroke="#eef1f2" stroke-opacity=".24" stroke-width="1.2"/>
                  <circle class="saw-svg__teeth-ring" cx="128" cy="174" r="76"
                          fill="none" stroke="#cbd0d2" stroke-width="7"
                          stroke-dasharray="3.5 8.8" stroke-linecap="square"/>
                  <g stroke="#6e777b" stroke-opacity=".28" stroke-width="1.1">
                    <path d="M128 110v47"/><path d="M160 118l-23 41"/><path d="M184 142l-42 24"/>
                    <path d="M192 174h-48"/><path d="M184 206l-42-24"/><path d="M160 230l-23-41"/>
                    <path d="M128 238v-47"/><path d="M96 230l23-41"/><path d="M72 206l42-24"/>
                    <path d="M64 174h48"/><path d="M72 142l42 24"/><path d="M96 118l23 41"/>
                  </g>
                  <circle cx="128" cy="174" r="19" fill="url(#motorCap)" stroke="#d6dbdd" stroke-width="2.6"/>
                  <circle cx="128" cy="174" r="7.2" fill="#171c1f" stroke="#8d979c" stroke-width="2"/>
                </g>

                <!-- cast upper guard -->
                <path class="saw-svg__guard"
                  d="M59 177
                     A72 72 0 0 1 197 135
                     L181 151
                     A54 54 0 0 0 77 181 Z"
                  fill="url(#castAluminum)" stroke="#596267" stroke-width="2.3"/>
                <path d="M72 156 A61 61 0 0 1 183 130"
                      fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity=".38" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M76 179 C80 139 100 116 133 108"
                      fill="none" stroke="#4f585c" stroke-opacity=".45" stroke-width="1.8"/>

                <!-- lower retractable guard / linkage -->
                <path d="M75 183 A56 56 0 0 0 172 205"
                      fill="none" stroke="#8e989c" stroke-width="8" stroke-opacity=".9"/>
                <path d="M76 183 A56 56 0 0 0 172 205"
                      fill="none" stroke="#e2e5e6" stroke-width="2" stroke-opacity=".38"/>
                <path d="M177 199 L195 214" fill="none" stroke="#454e52" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <circle cx="177" cy="199" r="5.2" fill="#252c2f" stroke="#aab1b4" stroke-width="1.6"/>

                <!-- main motor housing with layered shell -->
                <path class="saw-svg__body"
                  d="M167 101
                     C179 81 206 72 241 73
                     L316 78
                     C340 80 357 92 363 111
                     L368 143
                     C370 158 364 171 351 179
                     C326 194 286 195 253 191
                     L207 184
                     C184 181 169 166 167 145
                     L160 121
                     C157 112 159 105 167 101 Z"
                  fill="url(#bodyBlue)" stroke="#061725" stroke-width="2.4" filter="url(#bodyTexture)"/>
                <path d="M181 102 C211 85 278 86 338 100"
                      fill="none" stroke="#9ab2c4" stroke-opacity=".22" stroke-width="4.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M181 154 C219 166 291 165 352 147"
                      fill="none" stroke="#04131f" stroke-opacity=".46" stroke-width="3.5"/>
                <path d="M340 96 C353 103 359 114 360 129"
                      fill="none" stroke="#6487a0" stroke-opacity=".20" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>

                <!-- motor barrel cap -->
                <ellipse cx="343" cy="132" rx="30" ry="32" fill="url(#motorCap)" stroke="#596368" stroke-width="3"/>
                <ellipse cx="343" cy="132" rx="19" ry="21" fill="#151a1d" stroke="#30383c" stroke-width="2"/>
                <ellipse cx="343" cy="132" rx="6.5" ry="7.5" fill="#7f898e" opacity=".74"/>

                <!-- realistic vent slots -->
                <g stroke="#06131e" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".88">
                  <path d="M252 104l-2 28"/><path d="M264 103l-2 30"/><path d="M276 103l-2 31"/>
                  <path d="M288 104l-2 30"/><path d="M300 106l-2 27"/>
                </g>
                <g stroke="#7290a7" stroke-opacity=".18" stroke-width="1.1">
                  <path d="M251 101l-3 34"/><path d="M263 100l-3 36"/><path d="M275 100l-3 37"/>
                  <path d="M287 101l-3 36"/><path d="M299 103l-3 32"/>
                </g>

                <!-- rear handle with an actual opening and rubberized grip -->
                <path class="saw-svg__handle"
                  d="M207 90
                     C215 51 239 30 275 31
                     C309 32 329 52 332 82
                     L304 87
                     C302 65 289 54 273 54
                     C252 54 241 66 237 92 Z"
                  fill="url(#rubber)" stroke="#07090a" stroke-width="3.2"/>
                <path d="M238 62 C253 49 282 51 297 65"
                      fill="none" stroke="#5d6568" stroke-width="4.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".56"/>
                <path d="M306 81 L325 80" fill="none" stroke="#050708" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <rect x="292" y="75" width="18" height="10" rx="5" fill="#080a0b"/>
                <rect x="297" y="77" width="9" height="6" rx="3" fill="#c84e32" opacity=".78"/>

                <!-- front auxiliary grip -->
                <path class="saw-svg__front-grip"
                  d="M146 119
                     C147 94 158 79 175 76
                     L193 82
                     L188 119
                     L163 131 Z"
                  fill="url(#rubber)" stroke="#090c0e" stroke-width="2.6"/>
                <path d="M157 99 L180 91"
                      fill="none" stroke="#61696c" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".58"/>

                <!-- depth/bevel hardware -->
                <path d="M192 181 L213 216" fill="none" stroke="#555f64" stroke-width="5"/>
                <path d="M212 216 H239" fill="none" stroke="#242b2f" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <circle cx="203" cy="199" r="6" fill="#1f2528" stroke="#9ba4a8" stroke-width="2"/>
                <path d="M213 202 L229 191" fill="none" stroke="#6a7479" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <rect x="226" y="184" width="10" height="18" rx="4" fill="#272e31" stroke="#7f898e" stroke-width="1.4"/>

                <!-- fasteners and hardware -->
                <g fill="#b8c0c3" stroke="#3c4549" stroke-width="1.5">
                  <circle cx="199" cy="137" r="5.5"/>
                  <circle cx="228" cy="172" r="4.6"/>
                  <circle cx="318" cy="173" r="4.1"/>
                </g>
                <g stroke="#596267" stroke-width="1.4">
                  <path d="M196 137h6"/><path d="M225 172h6"/><path d="M315 173h6"/>
                </g>

                <!-- small unlabeled spec plate: realism without copying a brand -->
                <g transform="translate(287 151) rotate(-2)">
                  <rect width="47" height="16" rx="2.5" fill="#d8dcde" fill-opacity=".16" stroke="#bfc8cd" stroke-opacity=".19"/>
                  <path d="M6 5h25M6 9h34M6 12h20" stroke="#cbd4d9" stroke-opacity=".32" stroke-width="1"/>
                </g>

                <!-- cord exits the rear and disappears off-frame -->
                <path d="M365 120 C385 123 397 134 414 153"
                      fill="none" stroke="#121719" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M365 120 C385 123 397 134 414 153"
                      fill="none" stroke="#4b5356" stroke-opacity=".38" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </g>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="sawdust-burst" data-saw-dust aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <button type="button" class="saw-cut-hint saw-cut-trigger" data-saw-trigger>run the saw // yes, really</button>
        </div>

        <div class="sawdust-bench" data-sawdust-bench>
          <div class="sawdust-bench__engraving" data-bench-message>
            <span>BENCH TEST</span>
            <strong>Congratulations.</strong>
            <small>You have now cleaned more of my shop than I have today.</small>
          </div>
          <canvas data-sawdust-canvas aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

          <div class="sawdust-bench__wipe-cue" data-wipe-cue aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 58 42" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M5 12 20 4l29 7 4 23-20 5L8 34Z" fill="#d9c7ad" stroke="#6f5a43" stroke-width="2"/>
              <path d="m20 4 4 13 29-6M8 34l19-12 6 17M24 17l3 5m0 0 13-5" fill="none" stroke="#9d876c" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <path d="M5 12 27 22" fill="none" stroke="#f3eadf" stroke-width="1.6" opacity=".8"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Wipe the bench</span>
            <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>

          <button
            type="button"
            class="sawdust-bench__clear"
            data-bench-clear
            hidden
          >Clear the bench without dragging</button>
          <div class="sawdust-bench__impact" data-bench-impact aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section workshop-process">
    <div class="shell process-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Build process</p>
        <h2>Measure. Cut. Learn. Change the plan.</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">
          Project pages will document the problem, constraints, tools already on hand, build decisions, what failed, what changed, and what I would do differently next time.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-strip" aria-label="Workshop process">
        <div><span>01</span><strong>Need</strong></div>
        <div><span>02</span><strong>Sketch</strong></div>
        <div><span>03</span><strong>Build</strong></div>
        <div><span>04</span><strong>Use</strong></div>
        <div><span>05</span><strong>Revise</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark workshop-crossover">
    <div class="shell bridge-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">The crossover</p>
        <h2>Good jigs and good software share a personality.</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">
          Narrow purpose. Predictable behavior. Respect for constraints. Enough simplicity that the tool does not become the project.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="bridge-card bridge-card--copper">
        <span>CONTENT RIGHTS</span>
        <strong>Plans are deliberate, not automatically open source.</strong>
        <small>Photos, drawings, measurements, plans, and authored build content remain all rights reserved unless a specific project says otherwise.</small>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script src="../../scripts/workshop.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>
